  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Zigbee make the formatting of Zigbee UTC Time more readable and usable",
  "description": "zbee_zcl.attr.utc is a string representation of the time. Sometimes the numerical value for\nUTCTime is convenient (e.g. sorting by numbers rather than string representation of time).\nThis numerical value is now both displayed in the string UTC Time field and a second filter field,\nutc_raw, has been added for when the numerical value is needed, for example when using t-shark.\nThe new filter field is hidden so that it does not appear twice in the dissection which might\nbe confusing.",
